              "bn": "",
              "de": "",
              "en": "Muhammad ibn Yahya, from Ahmad ibn 'Isa, from 'Ali ibn al-Nu'man, from Dawud ibn Farqad, from Abu 'Abdillah (peace be upon him), who said:",
              "es": "",
