          {
            "chunk_type": "body",
            "translations": {
              "bn": "",
              "de": "",
              "en": "Allah took a Covenant upon the Momin (to have patience) such that his words would not be accepted as true and he would not avenge himself against his enemy. No Momin will find any satisfaction for his soul except through its disgrace (before his own conscience), for every Momin is harnessed (bridled from his worldly desires).",
